# Note: numba, pillow-heif, opencv-python-headless, esptool, and
# esp-idf-nvs-partition-gen are not available as Debian packages (or lack
# required modules). They are installed automatically via pip by the postinst
# script. python3-serial (pyserial) provides serial-port enumeration for the
# screen-flashing feature.
#
# Do NOT add ${python3:Depends} here. pybuild-plugin-pyproject reads
# pyproject.toml's dependencies list and dh_python3 maps esptool -> the Debian
# "esptool" package, which is absent from many apt sources, making the .deb
# uninstallable ("Depends: esptool but it is not installable"). The pip-only
# deps above are handled by postinst, so the Depends list below is authoritative.
Description: Spectra 6 e-ink image server for Hokku/Huessen frames
 Converts and serves images for Hokku e-paper frames using
 Floyd-Steinberg dithering to the 6-color Spectra 6 palette.
 Supports JPEG, PNG, WebP, HEIC, and other image formats.
 Includes fair image rotation and server-driven sleep scheduling.
